  "lim_1": {"kind":"menu","text":"<u>Limit Settings</u>\n<i> 7 of 19 active </i>\n\n<b>Active limits</b>\nDIRECT  <code>20 GB</code>\nTORRENT  <code>50 GB</code>\nYTDLP  <code>10 GB</code>\nLEECH  <code>4 GB</code>\nSTORAGE  <code>20 GB</code>\nCPU  <code>20%</code>\nSTATUS  <code>10 msgs</code>\n\n<b>How this works</b>\n• Send <code>0</code> to clear a limit and make it <i>unlimited</i>.\n• Sizes are in <b>GB</b> unless the table shows another unit.\n• <code>CPU_LIMIT</code> is a percentage, <code>STATUS_LIMIT</code> counts messages.\n• Limits apply per task, not per user.\n\n<i>Page </i><b>1</b><i> of 2</i>","rows":[[{"t":"DIRECT","to":"v_DIRECT_LIMIT","s":"success"},{"t":"MEGA","to":"v_MEGA_LIMIT"}],[{"t":"TORRENT","to":"v_TORRENT_LIMIT","s":"success"},{"t":"GD DL","to":"v_GD_DL_LIMIT"}],[{"t":"RC DL","to":"v_RC_DL_LIMIT"},{"t":"CLONE","to":"v_CLONE_LIMIT"}],[{"t":"JD","to":"v_JD_LIMIT"},{"t":"NZB","to":"v_NZB_LIMIT"}],[{"t":"SEEDR","to":"v_SEEDR_LIMIT"},{"t":"YTDLP","to":"v_YTDLP_LIMIT","s":"success"}],[{"t":"⫸","to":"lim_2"}],[{"t":"Back","to":"mod"},{"t":"Close","to":"__close","s":"danger"}]],"note":"Rich-message table in the real bot (Active limits + collapsible 'How this works'), shown here as plain text. Green buttons have a limit set."},
  "lim_2": {"kind":"menu","text":"<u>Limit Settings</u>\n<i> 7 of 19 active </i>\n\n<b>Active limits</b>\nDIRECT  <code>20 GB</code>\nTORRENT  <code>50 GB</code>\nYTDLP  <code>10 GB</code>\nLEECH  <code>4 GB</code>\nSTORAGE  <code>20 GB</code>\nCPU  <code>20%</code>\nSTATUS  <code>10 msgs</code>\n\n<b>How this works</b>\n• Send <code>0</code> to clear a limit and make it <i>unlimited</i>.\n• Sizes are in <b>GB</b> unless the table shows another unit.\n• <code>CPU_LIMIT</code> is a percentage, <code>STATUS_LIMIT</code> counts messages.\n• Limits apply per task, not per user.\n\n<i>Page </i><b>2</b><i> of 2</i>","rows":[[{"t":"PLAYLIST","to":"v_PLAYLIST_LIMIT"},{"t":"LEECH","to":"v_LEECH_LIMIT","s":"success"}],[{"t":"EXTRACT","to":"v_EXTRACT_LIMIT"},{"t":"ARCHIVE","to":"v_ARCHIVE_LIMIT"}],[{"t":"STORAGE","to":"v_STORAGE_LIMIT","s":"success"},{"t":"CPU","to":"v_CPU_LIMIT","s":"success"}],[{"t":"RSS SIZE","to":"v_RSS_SIZE_LIMIT"},{"t":"SEARCH","to":"v_SEARCH_LIMIT"}],[{"t":"STATUS","to":"v_STATUS_LIMIT","s":"success"}],[{"t":"⫷","to":"lim_1"}],[{"t":"Back","to":"mod"},{"t":"Close","to":"__close","s":"danger"}]]},
  "priv_0": {"kind":"menu","text":"⌬ <b>Private File Settings</b>\n┠ <b>Dashboard :</b> \n┃\n┠ <code>config.py</code> → <b>Exists</b>\n┠ <code>token.pickle</code> → <b>Not Exists</b>\n┠ <code>rclone.conf</code> → <b>Not Exists</b>\n┠ <code>accounts.zip</code> → <b>Not Exists</b>\n┠ <code>list_drives.txt</code> → <b>Not Exists</b>\n┠ <code>shortener.txt</code> → <b>Not Exists</b>\n┠ <code>categories.txt</code> → <b>Not Exists</b>\n┠ <code>cookies.txt</code> → <b>Not Exists</b>\n┠ <code>terabox.txt</code> → <b>Not Exists</b>\n┠ <code>.netrc</code> → <b>Exists</b>\n┃\n┠ <b>Delete File</b> → Send the file name as text message, Like <code>rclone.conf</code>.\n┃\n┖ <b>Note:</b> Changing .netrc will not take effect for aria2c until restart.","rows":[[{"t":"Create New File","to":"pn_0"},{"t":"Add/Delete File","to":"pe_0"}],[{"t":"Back","to":"main"},{"t":"Close","to":"__close","s":"danger"}]],"note":"Dashboard of the private files the bot reads; Exists/Not Exists is checked on disk each time."},
  "pe_0": {"kind":"prompt","text":"⌬ <b>Private File Settings</b>\n┠ <b>Dashboard :</b> \n┃\n┠ <code>config.py</code> → <b>Exists</b>\n┠ <code>token.pickle</code> → <b>Not Exists</b>\n┠ <code>rclone.conf</code> → <b>Not Exists</b>\n┠ <code>accounts.zip</code> → <b>Not Exists</b>\n┠ <code>list_drives.txt</code> → <b>Not Exists</b>\n┠ <code>shortener.txt</code> → <b>Not Exists</b>\n┠ <code>categories.txt</code> → <b>Not Exists</b>\n┠ <code>cookies.txt</code> → <b>Not Exists</b>\n┠ <code>terabox.txt</code> → <b>Not Exists</b>\n┠ <code>.netrc</code> → <b>Exists</b>\n┃\n┠ <b>Delete File</b> → Send the file name as text message, Like <code>rclone.conf</code>.\n┃\n┖ <b>Note:</b> Changing .netrc will not take effect for aria2c until restart.\n\n<i>Send the file name to delete the file, file to save the file & for new file create, follow below format.</i> \n\n<b>Format:</b> \n<code>file_name\n\ncontents of file</code></i>\n┖ <b>Time Left :</b> <code>60 sec</code>","rows":[[{"t":"Stop Invoke File","to":"priv_0"}],[{"t":"Back","to":"main"},{"t":"Close","to":"__close","s":"danger"}]],"reply":"rclone.conf  [file attached]","after":"priv_1","note":"Upload the file as a Telegram document with its real name (rclone.conf). Replying with only a file name as text deletes that file instead."},
